---
 .../bindings/leds/lacie,ns2-leds.yaml         | 85 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../devicetree/bindings/leds/leds-ns2.txt     | 35 --------
 2 files changed, 85 insertions(+), 35 deletions(-)
